'''Baozi Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be unlocked when rolling the [[Lunar New Year (Event Gacha)|Lunar New Year]] Event Gacha. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]]. It was later introduced into [[The Battle Cats Unite!]] in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.5 Update|Patch 1.0.5]] but is <u>only</u> exclusive to the '''Southeast Asia''' ('''SEA''') version via Package Version Bonus.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 202
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Baozi Cat
|name2 = Big Baozi
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Big Baozi''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
==='''Normal Form'''===
Very similar to Cat in terms of usage. Cheap and expendable, it can be summoned en masse to take hits in place of other, important units. This meatshield role is quite valuable, if not for the wide selection of cats able to perform this role without relevant differences in quality. Baozi Cat, however, can be used in 4 Crown stages, where there is considerably less competition. This is his only use.

==='''Evolved Form'''===
Due to the low stats, this form is not recommended as it is considerably worse than any possible alternative in about every way, making him into a waste of money when summoned. Could still be of use in early-mid [[Empire of Cats]], but, after that, it is best to revert this cat to its Normal Form and only use that.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield|EvolvedClass = Midranger|TrueClass=|UltraClass=}}

